OL,3,GNEWSAPatient of jailed surgeon recalled
OL,4,Ato hospital before her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has heard how a former
OL,7,Fpatient of jailed breast surgeon Ian
OL,8,FPaterson was recalled to hospital
OL,9,Fseveral years after he operated on her,
OL,10,Ffollowing concerns about the type of
OL,11,Fsurgery he had performed.
OL,13,FGillian Hudson died of metastatic
OL,14,Fbreast cancer in 2022.
OL,16,FShe became his patient after feeling a
OL,17,Flump in her right breast in 2003 and
OL,18,Fwas referred by her GP to the breast
OL,19,Fclinic at Solihull Hospital where
OL,20,FPaterson worked, and he later performed
OL,21,Fa mastectomy on her.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
