OL,3,GNEWSAPatient of jailed surgeon recalled
OL,4,Ato hospital before her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer inquest heard on Monday that she
OL,7,Fwas among patients recalled by the NHS
OL,8,Fin 2011 over concerns that some had
OL,9,Fundergone cleavage-sparing mastectomies
OL,10,F- an unregulated surgery he carried
OL,11,Fout, which left breast tissue behind.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
